# Cog VST — Implementation Plan

**Date:** 2026-03-28
**Status:** Retroactive Plan (Phase 2)
**Spec:** `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-03-28-cog-vst-design.md`

---

## Overview

This plan documents the implementation of Cog VST according to the design specification. The plugin is a psychedelic sound design module with spectral processing, resonant filters, and feedback-based sound mangling.

---

## 1. Architecture Summary

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                         SIGNAL FLOW                                  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                      │
│  INPUT ──► TextureBodyDetector ──┬──► Path A: Waveshaper            │
│                                   │        + LatencyCompDelay        │
│                                   │                                   │
│                                   └──► Path B: SpectralDroneEngine   │
│                                               + ChorusEnsemble       │
│                                                                      │
│  MERGE (crossfade) ──► FilterA + FilterB ──► DriveCircuit            │
│                         (parallel/series)                             │
│                                                                      │
│  FEEDBACK LOOP: Drive ──► DCBlocker ──► SoftClip ──► ×feedback ──► MERGE │
│                                                                      │
│  OUTPUT: StereoWidener ──► Limiter ──► OutputGain ──► DryWetMix      │
│                                                                      │
│  MODULATION: ModulationEngine ──► FilterA/B cutoffs                  │
│                                                                     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

