## 2. Class Architecture

### Core Classes

| Class | File | Responsibility |
|-------|------|----------------|
| `CogVSTAudioProcessor` | PluginProcessor.h/cpp | JUCE processor, APVTS, processBlock |
| `CogVSTAudioProcessorEditor` | PluginEditor.h/cpp | GUI (placeholder) |
| `TextureBodyDetector` | DSP/TextureBodyDetector.h/cpp | Envelope followers, spectral flux |
| `Waveshaper` | DSP/Waveshaper.h/cpp | Path A processing, soft/hard curves |
| `SpectralDroneEngine` | DSP/SpectralDroneEngine.h/cpp | 48kHz FFT processing |
| `ChorusEnsemble` | DSP/ChorusEnsemble.h/cpp | 4-voice chorus |
| `ResonantFilter` | DSP/ResonantFilter.h/cpp | TPT SVF with auto-gain |
| `DriveCircuit` | DSP/DriveCircuit.h/cpp | 3-stage drive with tone tilt |
| `StereoWidener` | DSP/StereoWidener.h/cpp | LR2 crossover, M/S processing |
| `ModulationEngine` | DSP/ModulationEngine.h/cpp | Ring-modulated LFOs |
| `DelayLine` | DSP/DelayLine.h | Fractional delay template |
| `DCBlocker` | DSP/DCBlocker.h | First-order HPF |
| `FastMath` | DSP/FastMath.h | Padé approximants, utilities |

